==Trivia==
*Just like the 11th anniversary, this event has a [[Doge]] motif because "one one" sounds like "wan wan" (わんわん), meaning "woof-woof".
**Also like the 11th anniversary, the event's aesthetic and stages are themed around classic JRPGs such as the ''[[wikipedia:Dragon Quest|Dragon Quest]]'' games.
*One of the cacti on Disaster in the Wan Wan Kingdom's map resembles a [[wikia:finalfantasy:Cactuar|cactuar]] from the ''[[wikipedia:Final Fantasy|Final Fantasy]]'' series, having the same pose and three quills sticking out the top of it.

